{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1511009001:0":{"text":"The Wedge of Power... think we'll see divine authority in action?","source_cn":"权能之楔……莫非会和神权有关？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C668D265B3C7826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511009002:0":{"text":"Ah... if only I had a chance to witness a divine battle...","source_cn":"啊，要是有机会目睹一场诸神混战该有多好啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x187524240E395518","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511009003:0":{"text":"That sounds like a disaster waiting to happen.","source_cn":"那会带来灾难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6055B99DE805A564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511009004:0":{"text":"Though the sealing wedges were placed by the gods, they don't hold the gods' powers themselves. They're closer to the core elements that shape the world.","source_cn":"封印之楔虽为诸神所设，但它不会承载诸神的权能，更趋近于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x469639DBA2C46644","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511009005:0":{"text":"We'll be confronting unrestrained power. Be prepared.","source_cn":"我们将要面对象征权能本身的力量。做好准备吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF39387BFE50783B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}}